                       │❯ add 'Otra dimensión' "Don't Stop"                                                        │
                       │2 track(s) added to the queue; playing Áurea — Otra dimensión                              │
                       │❯ play 'Otra dimensión'                                                                    │
                       │Playing Áurea — Otra dimensión (1 queued)                                                  │
                       │❯ pause                                                                                    │
                       │Paused                                                                                     │
                       │❯ help                                                                                     │
                       │available commands:                                                                        │
                       │  play [<query>...]     resume, or search the library and play                             │
                       │  select                pick a track with fuzzy search and play it                         │
                       │  pause                 pause playback                                                     │
                       │  toggle                toggle play/pause                                                  │
                       │  stop                  stop playback                                                      │
                       │  next                  next track                                                         │
                       │esc closes · enter runs · tab/shift+tab choose · ↑↓ history · pgup/pgdn output             │
